## What elimination means here, and its decider
The system as specified closes all three harbor entrances against
the design water class. Whether it ELIMINATES flooding in fact is a
hydrodynamic question this register design does not answer and does
not claim: performance stands NOT MEASURED. The named decider
(door D-NF3): hydrodynamic modelling of the three lines under the
design surge class, then scale-model testing - NOT EXECUTED.
Interior drainage, river discharge during closure, and rainfall
behind the lines are named open items, not solved silently here.

